    "Food and drink": "Coffee, idli, dosa, biryani, pickles and rice, ordering at a tiffin center and at home",
    "Home and daily things": "Rooms and objects, plurals in -లు, everyday adjectives, what is and is not there",
    "Time, days and routine": "Clock time, days of the week, a day in the habitual, yesterday and tomorrow",
    "Likes and free time": "Films, cricket, music, reading, likes with నాకు … ఇష్టం, and what you are doing now",
    "Getting around": "Places with -లో and -కి, left and right, autos, buses, the metro and trains",
    "Shopping and the market": "Prices, a little bargaining, clothes and vegetables, this one or that one, cheaper and bigger",
    "Health and help": "Feeling sick, the doctor and the pharmacy, must, must not and can, asking for help",
