    "Top adjectives": "The most-used describing words, with the \"is …\" form.",
    "Top adverbs": "Time, place, manner and degree: now, here, very, again, already.",
    "Top pronouns": "I, you, my, me, to me, mine, this, whose, someone: the whole useful set.",
